---
title: "7 · Send for e-signature"
description: Send a ready contract for signing online, follow the signers and receive the signed copy.
sidebar:
  order: 8
  label: "7 · Send for e-signature"
---

**Who:** the person in charge. **Where:** step 4 **Signing**.

{% steps %}

1. When the contract is **Ready**, select **Send for signature**. The signature boxes are placed from the marks in the template; nothing has to be dragged.
2. Each party signs online through an e-mail link, or is switched to paper.
3. Follow the signers on the **Signing** card.

{% /steps %}

{% screenshot id="crm/signing-ready" caption="Approved and ready to send." /%}

## The Signing card

The card shows each signer's status and the date on which the signing link expires. For each signer you can select **Send reminder**, **Change email** or **Switch to paper**. **Open in E-sign** shows the signing request itself.

{% screenshot id="crm/signing-sent" caption="Sent: each signer's status and link expiry." /%}

## When everyone has signed

The contract becomes **Signed**, and the signed PDF is filed in the opportunity's files automatically. If filing fails, it is tried again every 15 minutes.

If the client declines to sign, the contract returns to **Ready**, and the reason is shown.
